Two changes to yrs 0.26.0 that make its undo answer as Yjs's does in two of the three places where it does not
(native/src/crdt.rs, `Undo`, "Where yrs 0.26 is not Yjs"; docs/PARITY.md, Differs 26). NOT APPLIED: the core is
built with yrs as it is released, and says where that differs. This is what closing two of the differences takes,
measured, for whoever decides to carry a patched yrs.

1. src/store.rs `follow_redone`: a block put in again is followed with its offset, as Yjs's `followRedone` carries
   `diff`. Without it a step whose letters are the tail of a run deleted and put back twice takes back the head of
   the run too (test/live/undo_beside_others_test.dart, "letters of two steps deleted together and put back
   twice"). With it crdt.rs's own following of positions (`again`, `followed`) is no longer needed.
2. src/undo.rs `pop`: each run of a step's letters is cut as it is reached, as Yjs's `iterateDeletedStructs` cuts
   as it goes, where yrs reads every cut first and makes them after. Without it a step whose letters are two runs
   of one block overflows (and in a release build writes a block of a length it does not have), which is why
   crdt.rs lets the steps go when words reach a note while its editor is bound (`undo_forget`). With it that can
   be taken out, and the page's answer there (the steps kept) is this app's.

Measured 2026-10-11, with crdt.rs as it is: of 2,000 drawn scenarios of two members, forty steps each, each run
with the first member's client id the lower and again the higher (4,000 runs; GHOST_UNDO_SCENARIOS=2000 flutter
test test/live/undo_beside_others_test.dart), yrs as released parts from the page in 7 runs (scenarios 438, 696
and 1424 either way, by the first of these; 328 one way, by the third difference), and with this patch in 1 (328).
The third, which this does not touch: yrs leaves a block cut where Yjs joins it again (src/store.rs `materialize`,
"todo: txn merge blocks insert?"), so a run put back by an undo can be two runs where Yjs's is one.

To try it: copy the crate (~/.cargo/registry/src/*/yrs-0.26.0, less its benches and their [[bench]] entries in
Cargo.toml) to native/vendor/yrs, apply this there (patch -p1), and add `yrs = { path = "vendor/yrs" }` under
[patch.crates-io] in native/Cargo.toml.

--- a/src/store.rs
+++ b/src/store.rs
@@ -358,7 +358,12 @@
